      "writtenOn": "2017-06-09T05:28:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Since the lid is closed anyways, wouldn\u0027t it be better to keep trying to suspend - rather than staying up?\n\nOk. Then we can take out the forced lid open parts of the patches #2 and 3. How about signal assertion failure detection ? Should it be in EC or the kernel ?\n\nHow about this patch (which is independent of signal detection and forced lid open). The main comment is to split to common and board specific patches.",
